00:06:32.391 --> 00:06:36.423
<v Host>Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

00:06:37.024 --> 00:06:42.807
<v Slow>アルマジロの赤ちゃんは、いつ生まれましたか。

00:06:43.608 --> 00:06:49.151
<v Host>On August fifteenth, at Higashiyama Zoo and Botanical Gardens in Nagoya.

00:06:49.752 --> 00:06:55.728
<v Slow>アルマジロは、あぶないとき、何をしますか。

00:06:56.528 --> 00:07:02.480
<v Host>It rolls up its body and becomes like a ball, because its body is covered with hard armor.

00:07:03.079 --> 00:07:10.016
<v Slow>アルマジロの2日あとに、何の赤ちゃんが生まれましたか。

00:07:10.815 --> 00:07:14.800
<v Host>A slow loris — a small monkey that is active at night.

00:07:15.399 --> 00:07:23.367
<v Host>That's all for today. Two new babies at the zoo in one week — we hope they grow up big and strong. See you next time!

00:07:23.968 --> 00:07:26.367
<v News>また明日。
